;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">Max. Print Height</td><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">180 mm</td></tr><tr style=\"height:36px;\"><td style=\"background-color:#d9d9d9;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">Printing Board</td><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">Hoson</td></tr><tr style=\"height:36px;\"><td style=\"background-color:#d9d9d9;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">Ink Curing System</td><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">UV LED Light with Water-Based Cooling</td></tr><tr style=\"height:53px;\"><td style=\"background-color:#d9d9d9;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">Media Compatibility</td><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">Acrylic, Ceramic, Glass, Metal, Phone Cases, Bottles, Wood, Leather, UV Crystal Labels</td></tr><tr style=\"height:36px;\"><td style=\"background-color:#d9d9d9;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">Supported File Formats</td><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">PDF, JPG, TIFF, EPS, AI, etc.</td></tr><tr style=\"height:36px;\"><td style=\"background-color:#d9d9d9;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">RIP Software</td><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">Maintop / PhotoPrint</td></tr><tr style=\"height:36px;\"><td style=\"background-color:#d9d9d9;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">Power Consumption</td><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size:13.3334px;\">800 W</td></tr><tr style=\"height:36px;\"><td style=\"background-color:#d9d9d9;border-color:#ffffff;border-width:2px;font-size: